# SPC/E water box benchmark - representative of T12 MD campaign cost
units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
region box block 0 100 0 100 0 100
create_box 2 box bond/types 1 angle/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/angle/per/atom 1 extra/special/per/atom 2
mass 1 15.9994
mass 2 1.008
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 10.0
pair_coeff 1 1 0.15535 3.166
pair_coeff 1 2 0.0 0.0
pair_coeff 2 2 0.0 0.0
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 1000 1.0
angle_style harmonic
angle_coeff 1 100 109.47
molecule water spce.mol
lattice sc 3.2
create_atoms 0 box mol water 45238
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-4
fix rigid all shake 0.0001 20 0 b 1 a 1
velocity all create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix integrate all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
timestep 2.0
thermo 50
run 250
